What is the time complexity of the following subroutine as a function of n? Assume each instruction takes only O(1) time.

```c
sum = 0;
for (i = 1; i < n; i = i*2)
 for(j = 0; j < i; j = j+1)
 sum = sum + 1;

```

A. $O(n)$
B. $O(n \log n)$
C. $O(n^2)$
D. $O(n^2 \log n)$

